  "body": "Closes #6665 — light color-scheme on HTML preview iframe/srcdoc; includes tests.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nFixes the HTML response preview being unreadable in dark themes. The preview iframe inherited the app's dark `color-scheme`, which made unstyled HTML text invisible (light text on a light background). The preview now forces a light color-scheme unless the response HTML already declares its own.\n\n- Extracts srcdoc building (base href injection and color-scheme handling) into a `buildHtmlPreviewSrcdoc` helper.\n- Adds tests covering base href injection, color-scheme forcing, and case-insensitive meta name detection.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 600aba00d49b04f2944780ba5b3897c0e51577d0. Summary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a href=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/hoppscotch/hoppscotch/pull/6707?utm_source=github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Review in cubic\" src=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n",
